Developer pushes the code:

GitHub
   ↓
Jenkins

Jenkins gets the code and puts it in its workspace:

Jenkins Agent
     |
     └── Workspace
          |
          └── my-app
               ├── index.html
               ├── Dockerfile
               └── Jenkinsfile

Now Jenkins can work with those files.

For example:

Workspace
   ↓
mvn package
